  "content": "<html><head></head><body><p><a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/laravel-json-schema-validation-rules\"></a></p>\n                                        <hr>\n\n                    <p>JsonSchema::rules() turns a JSON schema into Laravel validation rules, so MCP and AI SDK tools can validate input with the schema they already declare.</p>\n\n                    <p>The post <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/laravel-json-schema-validation-rules\">Generate Laravel Validation Rules From a JSON Schema</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com\">Laravel News</a>.</p>\n                    <p>Join the <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/newsletter\">Laravel Newsletter</a> to get <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com\">Laravel</a> articles like this directly in your inbox.</p>\n\n                    </body></html>",
